### 1. All orders (default Page<T>)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders

### 2. Filter & paginate (?limit=5 returns 5 items, page 2 via offset=5)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders?limit=5&offset=5&sort=total_desc

### 3. Invalid limit (?limit=999 -> 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders?limit=999

### 4. Filter by status & area
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders?status=PENDING&area=Bole

### 5. Static route: pending orders
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders/pending

### 6. Orders for existing restaurant (id=1 -> Page<Order>)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/restaurants/1/orders

### 7. Orders for missing restaurant (id=99 -> 404 Not Found, not [])
GET http://localhost:3000/api/restaurants/99/orders

### 8. Update order status (PATCH -> 200 OK)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/orders/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PREPARING"
}

### 9. Invalid status value (PATCH -> 400 Bad Request)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/orders/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "INVALID_STATUS"
}

### 10. Delete existing order (DELETE -> 204 No Content, empty body)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/orders/13

### 11. Delete non-existent order (DELETE -> 404 Not Found)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/orders/999

### 12. Confirm deleted order is gone
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders/14